flowchart LR
    Admin[Administrator] --> Register[Register merchant or customer]
    Register --> User[Optional merchant login - required customer login]
    Register --> Records[(Marketplace records)]
    Admin --> Verify[Merchant pending - verified - suspended]
    Verify --> Records
    Merchant[Merchant role] --> Own[Own merchant profile and product report]
    Own --> Records
    Admin --> Catalogue[Categories and products]
    Catalogue --> Records
    Customer[Customer role] --> OwnOrders[Own profile and orders only]
